fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"svtav1/index.html#svtav1enc:logical-processors","fragment":"\n\tlogical-processors\n\nNumber of logical CPU cores to be used. Deprecated and replaced with level-of-parallelism in SVT-AV1 3.0.0. 0: auto\n\n\tFlags :\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\tRead\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tWrite\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\tDefault value :\t0\n\n"});